                "message": "🐛 Fix the footnote lint worker not finding sp-interaction\n\nThe worker is a bare `emacs -Q --batch` that only had the funct/ folder on its\nload-path, but sp-batch-report now requires sp-interaction from base/. It now\ngets the same module folders as init.el, skips sp-globals (needs early-init),\nand no longer needs sp-var-dir. A test runs the real worker command.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiD22hb7nU9mVzT6YQk",
